Create and manage immutable, team-scoped agent identities used by access grants and sessions. Deactivation retains history and revokes active sessions.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime agent [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create a managed agent in a team
  deactivate  Deactivate an agent
  get         Get an agent by immutable ID
  list        List agents in a team
  reactivate  Reactivate an agent
  rename      Rename an agent without changing its ID

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for agent

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime agent [command] --help" for more information about a command.
